1
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:46,544
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,544 --> 00:00:49,547
=Episode 15=

3
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:56,000
(What exactly is Ye Shen's regret?)

4
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,680
(Why wouldn't he tell me?)

5
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,000
(Could it be...)

6
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,200
Ye Shen,

7
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:07,360
answers to the multiple choice. Hurry.

8
00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:19,040
(Is his regret tied to these people?)

9
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:28,720
Lin Wei,

10
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,360
you're stuck on this one?

11
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:32,040
None of your business.

12
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,920
This one
is about spatial geometry concepts.

13
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:39,960
Isn't your family
in structural engineering?

14
00:01:40,520 --> 00:01:44,600
You're always bragging
about growing up on construction sites.

15
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:47,000
Said you could build skyscrapers
just by reading a blueprint?

16
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:51,400
So why can't you
draw a simple auxiliary line?

17
00:01:52,880 --> 00:01:55,400
If the family business
falls into your hands,

18
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:56,920
it might be a death trap.

19
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:03,680
To the rightful owner.

20
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:08,640
Gu Xiaotang, Ye Shen!

21
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:09,880
What are you doing?

22
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:18,160
Gu Xiaotang!

23
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:21,680
I thought you came back
to turn over a new leaf.

24
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:23,040
And now?

25
00:02:23,040 --> 00:02:25,320
You cheat on your very first day back.

26
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:27,240
Why bother coming back
with that attitude?

27
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:28,800
Miss,

28
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:30,360
- I...
- You're poisoning the whole class.

29
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:32,320
No, I didn't.

30
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,000
Ye Shen,

31
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:38,080
you've always made me proud,

32
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:39,520
great grades and great character.

33
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:41,120
What about your principles?

34
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,040
You're doing harm to her,

35
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:45,280
and to yourself.

36
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,400
Miss,

37
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,400
- Ye Shen was just...
- I'm sorry, ma'am.

38
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:48,880
It was my fault.

39
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:52,440
Enough. Not another word.

40
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:54,640
A 3,000-word self-criticism
from each of you.

41
00:02:55,160 --> 00:02:56,240
Due tomorrow morning.

42
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:03,800
You idiot, why did you take the fall?

43
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:14,040
Ye Shen,

44
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:15,280
what was that about today?

45
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:18,640
We're classmates.
What's wrong with helping a little?

46
00:03:19,320 --> 00:03:20,440
Anything else?

47
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:24,640
Yeah. I want to borrow
some of your notes.

48
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:25,640
No.

49
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,280
Give it back!

50
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,240
What?

51
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:39,120
Precious, huh?

52
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:43,160
You really are a dreamer, aren't you?

53
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:44,160
Lin Wei!

54
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,240
Put that paper back.

55
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,240
Gu Xiaotang,

56
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:52,640
what's it to you?

57
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:57,160
What? You think
you're his knight in shining armor?

58
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:00,640
Your shoes...

59
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:04,840
How did I never notice before?

60
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,520
What are you staring at?

61
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,520
Lin Wei,

62
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:10,080
you wear those knockoffs every day,

63
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:11,840
decked out like a Christmas tree.

64
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:12,840
Feeling insecure?

65
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,960
You're terrified
someone will see through it

66
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:16,520
that your fancy life is nothing

67
00:04:16,520 --> 00:04:19,200
but a hollow shell,
eaten alive by gambling debts, right?

68
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:25,800
Knowing that one day
you'll be pouring drinks for a paycheck,

69
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:30,120
I'd say that's a fair trade.

70
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:31,520
You're talking nonsense.

71
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:34,720
- Wei.
- Wei.

72
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:42,400
You little punks

73
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:44,040
bully people at school every day

74
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,120
and crush people's dreams.

75
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:46,920
Get lost.

76
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:48,840
Stay away from Ye Shen.

77
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,520
Don't you dare bully him again.

78
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,240
Let's go.

79
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,240
Let's go.

80
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,040
(I get it now.)

81
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:10,480
(Ye Shen's regret
is that he had a dream)

82
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:11,680
(but got laughed at,)

83
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:13,800
(so he gave up in the end.)

84
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:16,440
Ye Shen, listen.

85
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:19,080
From now on, I'll handle your problems.

86
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:20,520
Your homework...

87
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:23,960
Handle it yourself.

88
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:26,000
But if anyone bullies you again,

89
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:27,800
I've got your back.

90
00:05:28,880 --> 00:05:29,920
You draw beautifully.

91
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:30,920
Keep drawing.

92
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,120
Gu Xiaotang.

93
00:06:02,640 --> 00:06:03,840
You forgot your bag.

94
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:06,760
I knew I forgot something.

95
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:15,040
What's wrong with you today?

96
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,320
Since this morning, you...

97
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:19,520
You noticed too?

98
00:06:21,320 --> 00:06:22,640
Am I prettier than yesterday?

99
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,160
Where's your blueprint?

100
00:06:30,400 --> 00:06:32,400
Doesn't matter. I tossed it.

101
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:35,160
What? It matters a lot!

102
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:36,760
You have to chase that childhood dream.

103
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:38,040
Or you'll regret it.

104
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:40,400
Don't give up
just because Lin Wei and those girls

105
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:41,440
look down on you.

106
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:42,440
I told you before.

107
00:06:42,440 --> 00:06:43,760
You're really good at drawing.

108
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:48,480
Okay, got it.

109
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:50,640
Well, I should head back.

110
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:55,680
(Don't worry, Ye Shen.)

111
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:58,240
(This time, I'll protect your dream.)

112
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:00,280
(We're done with regrets.)

113
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:04,800
Talk.

114
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:06,720
When are you paying up?

115
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:08,480
When?

116
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:10,320
Tell me!

117
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:11,840
Sweetheart.

118
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:13,080
Babe.

119
00:07:13,960 --> 00:07:15,040
Asking for a beating?

120
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:19,720
Hey, girl, where are you going?

121
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,080
Come play.

122
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:30,160
I... I got roughed up.

123
00:07:31,280 --> 00:07:32,760
Someone roughed you up?

124
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:36,000
Aren't you always the one
dishing it out?

125
00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:38,960
I... How could I ever do that?

126
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:40,240
It was Gu Xiaotang.

127
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:42,800
She... She hit me.

128
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:43,920
Why'd she hit you?

129
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:48,160
She just hates my guts.

130
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:49,680
Gu Xiaotang?

131
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:51,680
That name rings a bell.

132
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,360
Ms. Lei,

133
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:55,760
she is Su Dawei's stepdaughter,
the one who owes us money.

134
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:57,520
Su Dawei?

135
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:04,760
What are the odds?

136
00:08:20,960 --> 00:08:24,200
Well, isn't this our hero, Gu Xiaotang?

137
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:27,960
What? Walking home alone?

138
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:32,680
Your family's broke?

139
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,440
Why go to school if you're broke?

140
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:38,200
Shouldn't you be working
to pay for your mom's meds?

141
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:40,960
(If it weren't for these people,)

142
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:42,920
(I wouldn't have dropped out
just to make money.)

143
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:48,120
We're not done here.

144
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:51,240
This slap

145
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:53,600
is for the old Gu Xiaotang,
the one you bullied.

146
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,040
You're asking for it!

147
00:08:57,320 --> 00:09:00,000
And this one is for your filthy mouth.

148
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:02,480
You think I'm the same

149
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:03,840
Gu Xiaotang you could push around?

150
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:11,520
Missy, you've got a mean swing.

151
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:14,920
Ms. Lei, you saw it all, right?

152
00:09:14,920 --> 00:09:15,920
She bullied me!

153
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:20,520
I don't hit women.

154
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:22,240
Can't have you saying
we ganged up on you.

155
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:26,080
So here's the deal.
Get on your knees and apologize,

156
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,120
and we'll call it even.

157
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:30,040
Fake chivalry.

158
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:31,640
Apologize to her?

159
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,040
Not a chance.

160
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,600
You sure?

161
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:39,040
Ms. Lei,
why are you wasting your breath?

162
00:09:39,040 --> 00:09:40,040
Just get her!

163
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:42,440
Don't you dare touch her!

164
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,600
Ye Shen?

165
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:49,920
Playing the hero, huh?

166
00:09:50,880 --> 00:09:52,840
What? Is she your girlfriend?

167
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:53,840
She is.

168
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:00,640
Then don't blame me for being rude.

169
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,200
Yeah?

170
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:07,200
Yeah.

171
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:35,040
(I'll always be by your side.)

172
00:10:41,520 --> 00:10:42,520
Watch out!

173
00:10:44,736 --> 00:10:50,600
♪Day after day,
the same clumsy ending plays out♪

174
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:52,240
(No matter how many loops,)

175
00:10:52,920 --> 00:10:55,440
(you always stand in front of me
and protect me.)

176
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:58,000
(Whatever your regret is,)

177
00:10:58,520 --> 00:11:04,120
(this time,
let me create a perfect ending for you.)

178
00:11:07,216 --> 00:11:13,263
♪You're like a silent movie in my mind♪

179
00:11:38,650 --> 00:11:42,006
♪The face deep in the heart♪

180
00:11:42,198 --> 00:11:44,660
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

181
00:11:46,035 --> 00:11:49,735
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

182
00:11:49,946 --> 00:11:52,386
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

183
00:11:52,533 --> 00:11:54,905
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

184
00:11:55,055 --> 00:11:57,812
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

185
00:11:57,812 --> 00:12:00,133
♪Even for just a second♪

186
00:12:01,478 --> 00:12:04,941
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

187
00:12:05,069 --> 00:12:06,918
♪And sunlight reverses♪

188
00:12:06,918 --> 00:12:10,388
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

189
00:12:10,744 --> 00:12:12,818
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

190
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:16,729
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

191
00:12:16,986 --> 00:12:22,198
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

192
00:12:23,452 --> 00:12:26,017
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

193
00:12:26,059 --> 00:12:29,512
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

194
00:12:30,089 --> 00:12:33,052
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

195
00:12:33,797 --> 00:12:36,405
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

196
00:12:36,405 --> 00:12:40,028
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

197
00:12:40,498 --> 00:12:44,554
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
